      "en": "When he comes home, he calls together his friends and his neighbors, saying to them, ‘Rejoice with me, for I have found my sheep which was lost!’",
      "ko": "집에 와서 그 벗과 이웃을 불러 모으고 말하되 나와 함께 즐기자 나의 잃은 양을 찾았노라 하리라",
      "source_text_hash": "a3cfc1eaa5f28eb315742bcd50a8ffb04d3f5907615133470b712387b8a36602",
      "translation_text_hash": "81b2fdd59272a551923d6436864aa97692a215ae2a57eb55ecfcd2811d0a7d54",
