      "en": "The younger of them said to his father, ‘Father, give me my share of your property.’ So he divided his livelihood between them.",
      "ko": "그 둘째가 아비에게 말하되 아버지여 재산 중에서 내게 돌아올 분깃을 내게 주소서 하는지라 아비가 그 살림을 각각 나눠 주었더니",
      "source_text_hash": "521c5b1a3aafc9d1489ffa8c8f3089d848a74e404f0af53a221b73d39843acba",
      "translation_text_hash": "2fbb973560d07371beeee6c34d036e9fd2cf1d8e4b9b425e938b2633e5237005",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
