      "en": "Bring the fattened calf, kill it, and let’s eat and celebrate;",
      "ko": "그리고 살진 송아지를 끌어다가 잡으라 우리가 먹고 즐기자",
      "source_text_hash": "15e7f3e81793f45fb3bfd7ad97f7765f48ea3d9dfe9d75a39e47938569b8617d",
      "translation_text_hash": "c330bd467f193dcd53f375c14571585e79de93659463880f5445d186e9f478db",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
