      "en": "He called one of the servants to him and asked what was going on.",
      "ko": "한 종을 불러 이 무슨 일인가 물은대",
      "source_text_hash": "926d9dbb220dee22906c945673e745f8d89940cc335c7ed3043a12e75a82d5f4",
      "translation_text_hash": "ba1db2e76e05bcdcee96d739b8820ca6e621d15360daed56da30d4a174d9e246",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
