      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "LUK",
          "chapter": 15,
          "verse": 28
        }
      ],
      "en": "But he was angry and would not go in. Therefore his father came out and begged him.",
      "ko": "저가 노하여 들어가기를 즐겨 아니하거늘 아버지가 나와서 권한대",
      "source_text_hash": "eecda6745ca1fb73e32e68597b85e19428595c4a2e3af78c38d9679f8f710cc0",
      "translation_text_hash": "f61b9eca10ad384f5df5c21608e4582a076973772bd0b646bc40416814e5c22c",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
